<h2>Information We Collect</h2>

<p>
  When you use the contact form on this website, we collect your name, email address, and message. This information is
  sent to us via email and is used solely to respond to your inquiry.
</p>

<p>
  We also store your theme preference (light/dark/system) in your browser's local storage. This is a purely functional
  feature that enhances your experience and is not used for tracking.
</p>

<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>

<p>
  We use the information you provide through the contact form only to respond to your message. We do not sell, share, or
  otherwise disclose your personal information to third parties.
</p>

<h2>Data Retention</h2>

<p>
  Contact form submissions are retained only as long as necessary to address your inquiry. If you would like us to
  delete your data, please contact us.
</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>

<p>
  This website does not use cookies. We use local storage solely for your theme preference, which is stored on your
  device and is not accessible to us.
</p>

<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
  This website is hosted as a static site. Contact form submissions are processed through our API. No third-party
  analytics, advertising, or tracking services are used.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>

<p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
